00:41:20.400 --> 00:41:21.900
I'm sorry.

00:41:22.500 --> 00:41:22.680
I'm sorry.

00:41:22.680 --> 00:41:22.760
I'm sorry.

00:41:23.240 --> 00:41:23.420
I'm sorry.

00:41:23.580 --> 00:41:24.100
I'm sorry.

00:41:24.100 --> 00:41:24.260
I'm sorry.

00:41:24.260 --> 00:41:25.480
I'm sorry.

00:41:26.320 --> 00:41:26.620
I'm sorry.

00:41:26.720 --> 00:41:28.020
I'm sorry.

00:41:28.020 --> 00:41:29.940
Even if Heavenly Father forgives me, I will...

00:41:35.760 --> 00:41:38.740
I don't know Chico at all!

00:41:38.760 --> 00:41:39.260
I don't know!

00:41:39.420 --> 00:41:45.400
Chico-san, you came early, so go to the classroom quickly.

00:41:45.480 --> 00:41:45.920
That's good.

00:41:46.500 --> 00:41:52.140
Bimo, hurry up and finish your work.

00:42:00.250 --> 00:42:02.400
I'll be late if I don't do it.

00:42:02.440 --> 00:42:03.360
I don't like it.

00:42:03.700 --> 00:42:06.400
That's right.

00:42:07.300 --> 00:42:22.610
It's finally quiet.

00:42:23.400 --> 00:42:25.920
But our fight starts now.

00:42:26.080 --> 00:42:26.640
What happened?

00:42:30.320 --> 00:42:32.220
I thought something like this would never happen again.

00:42:33.040 --> 00:42:35.020
Even so, even so,

00:42:35.120 --> 00:42:37.440
with such a boring thing like this,

00:42:37.440 --> 00:42:38.440
you idiot!

00:43:31.530 --> 00:43:33.270
I'm late because of you today, too.

00:43:33.350 --> 00:43:34.800
What are you going to do with me?

00:43:34.880 --> 00:43:37.180
What did you say?

00:43:38.070 --> 00:43:38.730
You...

00:43:38.730 --> 00:43:40.670
You are...

00:43:40.670 --> 00:43:43.650
And you bring robots every day.

00:43:44.350 --> 00:43:45.970
You say that without any evidence.

00:43:46.830 --> 00:43:48.310
Do you think it's okay if I'm not late?

00:43:49.510 --> 00:43:50.560
I knew it.

00:43:50.900 --> 00:43:52.060
I knew you were that kind of person.

00:43:52.680 --> 00:43:53.300
That's right.

00:43:53.440 --> 00:43:54.240
You always say it.

00:43:54.600 --> 00:43:57.320
If I'm saved, I don't care what happens to me.

00:43:58.120 --> 00:43:59.360
I don't like you from a long time ago.

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:04.000
You're the main character, and I'm the villain!

00:44:04.124 --> 00:44:04.744
Sounds good!

00:44:04.988 --> 00:44:06.368
Evil balls are evil balls!

00:44:06.556 --> 00:44:07.956
I'll put an end to it!

00:44:08.636 --> 00:44:09.336
No way!

00:44:11.580 --> 00:44:12.080
Shut up!

00:44:23.100 --> 00:44:24.480
This seductive M-Line!

00:44:25.052 --> 00:44:26.532
Akagiyama No.23

00:44:26.588 --> 00:44:27.828
I'm going to fight you with this!

00:44:50.990 --> 00:44:51.550
Answer me!

00:45:03.930 --> 00:45:05.390
I'm sorry, but this is the end.

00:45:06.350 --> 00:45:07.820
That's my line.

00:45:24.810 --> 00:45:25.630
How are you feeling?

00:45:25.850 --> 00:45:27.420
I haven't had any problems so far.

00:45:34.030 --> 00:45:36.950
So, the Constellation was destroyed instead of an accident?

00:45:38.720 --> 00:45:42.500
Yeah. The Space Department and the Supervisory Department have been looking at it that way.

00:45:43.830 --> 00:45:44.810
But what the hell is going on?

00:45:45.000 --> 00:45:52.170
The station said that it was impossible to set explosives before the launch.

00:45:52.470 --> 00:45:55.040
No way. Then?

00:45:55.380 --> 00:45:57.770
That possibility is also possible.

00:46:00.124 --> 00:46:01.984
Think about it.

00:46:01.984 --> 00:46:08.484
Don't you think it's strange that they were able to recover in just 16 years?

00:46:43.530 --> 00:46:45.450
Yes, please take it.

00:46:45.820 --> 00:46:51.740
This is CD138621S113, code name E.

00:46:51.980 --> 00:46:53.960
You're getting better every time I contact you.

00:46:55.360 --> 00:46:57.480
Yes, I'm doing my best.

00:47:00.440 --> 00:47:02.460
By the way, what about the survey data?

00:47:02.940 --> 00:47:04.320
Ah, right away!

00:47:04.460 --> 00:47:08.640
The monitor is here.

00:47:08.980 --> 00:47:09.830
Turn the monitor.

00:47:10.650 --> 00:47:10.970
Turning.

00:47:11.310 --> 00:47:14.140
There may be a slight bar noise and a clutch.

00:47:15.080 --> 00:47:17.130
It may be due to an accident during the survey.

00:47:18.160 --> 00:47:19.840
Even with the program auto recording method,

00:47:20.180 --> 00:47:23.160
since the subject is close to the speed and repeats approaching and leaving,

00:47:24.140 --> 00:47:27.360
the sequence monitor is burnt out and the ego is manual.

00:47:27.780 --> 00:47:29.920
Huh? That's an ego?

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:32.820
This is Chatter Preliminary A2, right?

00:47:33.340 --> 00:47:35.260
I think it's 28B-11.

00:47:35.820 --> 00:47:37.960
The shutter speed is 1,000th of a second.

00:47:38.220 --> 00:47:38.960
You did a good job.

00:47:39.140 --> 00:47:40.300
I'm sure it's the Princess.

00:47:40.780 --> 00:47:43.510
I'll head over there right away.

00:47:43.950 --> 00:47:46.630
You go straight to the second stage of the order.

00:47:47.330 --> 00:47:48.440
I understand.

00:47:48.780 --> 00:47:49.870
I'll move on to the second stage.

00:47:51.090 --> 00:47:55.310
I've been wandering around the universe for six years.

00:47:55.630 --> 00:47:57.610
Finally, the time has come to go home.

00:48:00.990 --> 00:48:03.420
What the hell is going on?

00:48:03.860 --> 00:48:17.970
What's going on?

00:48:19.690 --> 00:48:21.550
An unidentified flying object has appeared in the area.

00:48:21.550 --> 00:48:22.690
It's approaching rapidly.

00:48:23.030 --> 00:48:24.150
It will be in contact with the station in about 40 minutes.

00:48:25.690 --> 00:48:26.090
What?

00:48:26.650 --> 00:48:29.820
An unidentified flying object...

00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:31.800
The combat power level is estimated to be 300 or more.

00:48:32.040 --> 00:48:33.960
Enter the second battle formation!

00:48:34.440 --> 00:48:36.310
Roger that. I'll tell the strategy unit.

00:48:36.850 --> 00:48:38.210
Let's scramble immediately.

00:48:38.410 --> 00:48:40.300
Repeat. I'll tell the strategy unit.

00:48:40.740 --> 00:48:41.960
Let's scramble immediately.

00:49:19.290 --> 00:49:19.370
Let's go!

00:49:45.130 --> 00:49:46.110
This is the first time I've seen this kind of performance.

00:50:21.790 --> 00:50:28.860
What the hell! If there's a princess on this planet, there's no point in staying here for a while!

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:32.700
I must rescue the princess and bring her back to my main ship!

00:50:32.920 --> 00:50:35.140
I must immediately counterattack the enemy's second ship!

00:50:36.240 --> 00:50:38.550
I must annihilate those who stand in my way!

00:51:49.840 --> 00:51:50.520
I've found a new base.

00:51:51.100 --> 00:51:53.880
I don't have time to waste here.

00:51:53.880 --> 00:51:55.400
Let's get out of here at once.

00:54:04.480 --> 00:54:12.440
It's dangerous, but it's true!

00:54:13.050 --> 00:54:22.610
If you don't understand that it's useless,

00:54:23.570 --> 00:54:26.800
you'll have to let your body tell you what to do!

00:54:36.780 --> 00:54:37.200
What a shame!

00:55:22.810 --> 00:55:28.530
I don't know where I went, but I answered instead.

00:55:33.910 --> 00:55:35.390
What's wrong with you, C-ko-san?

00:55:35.470 --> 00:55:36.740
What's wrong with B-ko-san and C-ko-san?

00:55:37.920 --> 00:55:38.560
Um...

00:55:38.960 --> 00:55:52.240
Wait, what are you doing?

00:55:53.200 --> 00:55:53.520
Eh?

00:55:54.740 --> 00:55:55.060
Ah!

00:56:30.284 --> 00:56:31.224
This is...

00:56:31.372 --> 00:56:31.872
What are you doing?

00:57:02.010 --> 00:57:13.830
The space ship has broken through the atmosphere.

00:57:15.450 --> 00:57:17.500
Commander, we'll be in contact with the squadron in 5 minutes.

00:57:18.100 --> 00:57:19.820
They're finally here.

00:57:20.180 --> 00:57:26.380
This is Apple I.

00:57:26.720 --> 00:57:29.640
We can't capture the target with the naked eye yet, but the radar...

00:57:31.920 --> 00:57:35.120
From the Apple I to the Zenki, to confirm the object of flight, we will rise further.

00:57:36.050 --> 00:57:37.270
Zenki Tsuzuku-ya!

00:57:38.770 --> 00:57:39.110
Ah!

00:58:43.980 --> 00:58:46.290
It is a monster with a length of 6,500 meters.

00:58:50.560 --> 00:58:52.900
Target confirmed. Attack immediately as planned.

00:59:01.120 --> 00:59:02.120
Contact with enemy aircraft!

01:00:35.120 --> 01:00:36.400
I told you to stop right there!

01:01:00.280 --> 01:01:01.220
We all have to get out of the city!

01:01:02.100 --> 01:01:03.800
Enzo, Agumon, let's go!

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:31.860
If that's the case, I'd like to see a tank or something.

01:02:07.040 --> 01:02:27.100
I'm scared.

01:03:00.000 --> 01:03:00.200
Where are you going?

01:03:00.860 --> 01:03:02.500
Where are you going, Fico?

01:03:02.640 --> 01:03:03.360
Didn't you see that?

01:03:03.740 --> 01:03:05.160
Shinko was kidnapped!

01:03:05.660 --> 01:03:06.680
Don't you think so?

01:03:08.600 --> 01:03:09.380
That's...

01:03:09.380 --> 01:03:11.690
Anyway, we have to bring back Shinko first!

01:03:12.350 --> 01:03:12.870
What?

01:03:16.160 --> 01:03:17.140
I also...

01:03:17.360 --> 01:03:18.320
Wait a minute!

01:03:19.140 --> 01:03:27.090
Don't get in my way!

01:03:30.440 --> 01:03:32.590
Please don't go! You can go back to your own planet!

01:03:33.810 --> 01:03:41.780
What are you saying?

01:03:42.000 --> 01:03:42.740
I'm going to ascend!

01:04:12.540 --> 01:04:13.160
It's just a matter of saving the Sheik.

01:04:14.760 --> 01:04:16.280
Get out!

01:04:16.460 --> 01:04:29.050
Don't touch me!

01:04:45.040 --> 01:04:45.360
Yeah.

01:04:45.440 --> 01:04:45.660
Yeah.

01:05:41.580 --> 01:05:42.000
That's not what I meant!

01:06:11.200 --> 01:06:12.910
Why is your heart closed?

01:06:15.490 --> 01:06:15.930
Why?

01:06:16.110 --> 01:06:26.700
What's going on?

01:06:27.730 --> 01:06:28.940
Please come to the bridge.

01:06:30.508 --> 01:06:31.428
I got it.

01:07:22.140 --> 01:07:23.390
What's wrong?

01:07:23.510 --> 01:07:26.780
I'm sorry. A rat has entered.

01:07:27.180 --> 01:07:28.560
A rat?

01:07:28.840 --> 01:07:29.060
Yes.

01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:33.420
It seems that those who were attached to the princess have come this far.

01:07:33.720 --> 01:07:35.270
What did you say?

01:07:36.140 --> 01:07:39.610
But please leave it to me. I'll clean it up right away.

01:08:26.650 --> 01:08:27.510
Did you do something to her?

01:08:32.880 --> 01:08:33.020
Huh?

01:08:33.300 --> 01:08:39.670
Poor thing.

01:08:39.910 --> 01:08:41.650
You were sleeping with the medicine, weren't you?

01:08:41.730 --> 01:08:44.250
I got tired of it, so I twisted it.

01:08:47.000 --> 01:08:48.240
Anyway, get out of here as soon as possible.

01:08:48.800 --> 01:08:49.120
Where?

01:08:50.490 --> 01:08:52.170
Chico, Eiko, it doesn't matter.

01:08:52.550 --> 01:08:53.610
Now, let's get out of here.

01:08:57.340 --> 01:08:58.300
Now, don't cry.

01:09:00.410 --> 01:09:02.180
Well, how do we get out of here?

01:09:02.300 --> 01:09:06.200
We can't take the Seekers from the window, so we should steal their planes.

01:10:04.220 --> 01:10:04.360
I...

01:10:04.360 --> 01:10:16.090
I won't let you get away with this!

01:10:16.090 --> 01:10:17.990
Gyo Gyo! Don't attack from behind!

01:10:21.880 --> 01:10:23.100
I won't allow you to go any further!

01:10:24.600 --> 01:10:28.800
If you really want to go, you have to defeat me!

01:10:30.220 --> 01:10:37.800
Don't run away so easily!

01:10:38.000 --> 01:10:40.540
I'll make you feel better...

01:10:41.440 --> 01:10:50.160
I'll make you feel better...

01:10:50.160 --> 01:10:50.980
I'll make you feel better...

01:10:50.980 --> 01:10:56.510
I'll make you feel better...

01:11:10.044 --> 01:11:11.924
It's easy to get beaten up!

01:11:14.460 --> 01:11:16.460
Thank you for watching!

01:11:36.044 --> 01:11:37.644
Isn't this the exit?

01:11:37.900 --> 01:11:38.920
This is complicated!

01:12:01.050 --> 01:12:01.390
HOOH!

01:12:02.710 --> 01:12:03.030
HOOH!

01:12:03.500 --> 01:12:03.820
HOOH!

01:12:05.630 --> 01:12:05.830
Gah!

01:12:35.660 --> 01:12:35.960
What is it?

01:12:37.260 --> 01:12:38.880
Give me back my friend!

01:12:39.710 --> 01:12:40.830
Your friend?

01:12:41.570 --> 01:12:42.170
Hehehe

01:12:43.080 --> 01:12:44.680
That person is...

01:12:44.680 --> 01:12:48.890
the 4th...

01:12:48.890 --> 01:12:50.170
What are you talking about?

01:12:50.210 --> 01:12:51.910
Give me back my friend!

01:12:53.630 --> 01:12:55.150
Don't you dare talk to me like that.

01:12:56.050 --> 01:12:56.350
Oh!

01:12:57.120 --> 01:12:57.300
What?

01:13:00.320 --> 01:13:01.490
He's gone...

01:13:01.490 --> 01:13:03.400
Gaku!

01:13:03.600 --> 01:13:04.300
Come with me!

01:13:04.970 --> 01:13:06.640
More importantly, give me...

01:13:06.640 --> 01:13:07.430
Give me my sake!

01:13:07.530 --> 01:13:08.030
I need it!

01:13:08.510 --> 01:13:11.390
I think I messed up again.

01:13:11.770 --> 01:13:12.270
Princess!

01:13:17.060 --> 01:13:18.090
Eiko...

01:13:19.300 --> 01:13:22.060
Well, whatever.

01:13:22.280 --> 01:13:23.140
That's that.

01:13:23.400 --> 01:13:24.030
I saved Shiko,

01:13:25.050 --> 01:13:26.770
and I'll stop fighting!

01:13:26.790 --> 01:13:27.600
Eiko!

01:13:27.720 --> 01:13:28.260
What?!

01:13:31.050 --> 01:13:32.330
What do you mean?!

01:13:32.330 --> 01:13:36.530
What?!

01:13:36.530 --> 01:13:45.080
What will you do if you're a useless figure?!

01:13:45.080 --> 01:13:50.990
Stop it!

01:13:51.270 --> 01:13:52.080
Stop it!

01:13:52.340 --> 01:13:52.640
Don't go!

01:13:58.280 --> 01:13:58.560
Shut up!

01:14:00.348 --> 01:14:02.348
You

01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:30.280
Thank you.

01:14:31.340 --> 01:14:33.340
Thanks for watching!

01:15:07.868 --> 01:15:08.368
Thank you!

01:16:34.220 --> 01:16:37.320
Tonriya Ezakura, Batwolf Nanahikari

01:16:37.320 --> 01:16:38.220
What the-

01:16:43.244 --> 01:16:44.204
WHAT THE HECK?!

01:18:01.244 --> 01:18:01.744
Alright!

01:18:01.760 --> 01:18:02.440
It's decided!

01:18:36.240 --> 01:18:36.360
Thank you.

01:19:01.050 --> 01:19:01.250
I need you.

01:21:30.060 --> 01:21:30.280
Dream.
